      "title": "Given duplicate or reordered supported events for one normalized subject, compilation must emit exactly one queue entry at the newest relevant revision with byte-identical replay; every registered malformed, scope, routing, sealing, and direct-write mutation must be refused, and exact Q3/full test gates must pass without network or production mutation. (Stories: US-001; Acceptance: AC-001)",
